{"Title":"An Act establishing the official marine invertebrate of the Commonwealth","BillNumber":"S1989","DocketNumber":"SD912","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:31:48.423"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T16:31:48.4233333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S1989/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Cyr, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 1989) of Julian Cyr for legislation to establish the official marine invertebrate of the Commonwealth.  State Administration and Regulatory Oversight.","DocumentText":"\tChapter 2 of the General Laws, as most recently amended by chapter 54 of the acts of 2022, is hereby further amended by adding the following section:- \r\n\tSECTION 1. Section 65. The Limulus Polyphemus shall be the official marine invertebrate of the Commonwealth.   \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J25","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J25"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}